        {
          "text": "Tolemutu akipeyos na inomio toliwor akimuj na epeikinitoe Ekapolon Akuj, na ejoikinit ngesi akukuny keng. Tolemutu emong losorokit epei, ka amesek apei, ta ngimesekin lukiliok ngikan-kaarei lu eraakasi ngikaru ngipei-pei, tamam ni ichwangakina. ",
